      <title>Meta拆分Horizon手机App游戏功能，Eclipse项目将推出独立Horizon Create</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260831/Meta%E6%8B%86%E5%88%86Horizon%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BAApp%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BDEclipse%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B0%86%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8BHorizon-Create/</link>
